---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const quickStart = `bun add @icen.ai/ui`;
const quickStartCss = `import '@icen.ai/ui/tokens.css';
import '@icen.ai/ui/ui.css';`;
const quickStartHtml = `<html class="piano dark"> … </html>`;
---
<Base title="ICEN UI · 设计系统">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="hero-title">ICEN UI</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">icen.ai 生态的统一设计系统——6 套色彩预设 × 明暗双模 × 无框架组件</p>
    <div class="demo-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/components/">浏览组件 →</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/primitives/">查看原语 →</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/icen-ai/ui" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="panel-block">
    <div class="panel-title"><span>统一抽象层</span><span>v0.3 新增</span></div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p class="dim">31 个组件共享同一套抽象：<strong>6 个交互基元 class</strong>（<code>.pressable</code> / <code>.control</code> / <code>.field</code> / <code>.lift</code> / <code>.surface-elevated</code> / <code>.focus-ring</code>）+ <strong><code>--icen-*</code> 原语 token</strong>（聚焦环 / 悬停 / 按下 / 禁用 / 过渡）。风格 profile 只覆盖少数变量，全局换肤。</p>
      <p class="dim" style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/primitives/">→ 前往原语页查看演示</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel-block">
    <div class="panel-title"><span>设计 Tokens</span></div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <div class="token-layers">
        <div class="token-layer">
          <div class="token-layer-name">色彩预设</div>
          <p class="dim">6 套完整配色（clay / piano / art / vangogh / ink / retro），每套定义全部 --token-* 色板，挂同名类即切换。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="token-layer">
          <div class="token-layer-name">风格配置</div>
          <p class="dim">style-modern / style-retro / style-terminal 第二层抽象，只覆盖字体、圆角、阴影硬度等与颜色正交的变量。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="token-layer">
          <div class="token-layer-name">明暗双模</div>
          <p class="dim">每个预设各含 .dark 变体，挂 dark 类即可在亮/暗之间切换，语义色与阴影随之整体翻转。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel-block">
    <div class="panel-title"><span>快速开始</span></div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p class="dim">安装设计系统包：</p>
      <pre><code>{quickStart}</code></pre>
      <p class="dim">在入口引入 tokens 与全部组件样式：</p>
      <pre><code>{quickStartCss}</code></pre>
      <p class="dim">在 <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> 上挂预设与明暗类（示例：piano 预设 + 暗色）：</p>
      <pre><code>{quickStartHtml}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 48px 0 40px; }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 56px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    color: var(--token-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 0 0 26px;
  }
  .token-layers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .token-layer-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--token-accent-deep, var(--token-accent));
  }
  .token-layer p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
